<title>ESTONIA: UHIS CUM-DIV TRADING ENDS.</title>
<headline>UHIS CUM-DIV TRADING ENDS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Uhispank shares are traded cum-dividend the last day today, the Tallinn Stock Exchange said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>Uhispank issues one share for every 20 existing shares.</p>
<p>Uhispank will raise its share capital by 11.75 million kroons through a bonus share issue from its present 50 million kroons.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn Newsroom, +372 630 8400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
